# The debug readout (main.c, debug_3d): 5 lines top left in play; none on the spectator view;
# back once the loop is broken and the camera's down in the cycle.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
skip_prologue # straight to play, the cycle at its start
wait 12.4
shot debug_play
# A twice: play -> the opening flight -> the loop (directions don't hit the loop while it flies)
press start
press a 2
press start
wait 1
shot debug_spectate
press left
wait 0.5
press left
wait 0.5
press left
wait 3.5 # the camera comes down into the cycle (3 s), then play
shot debug_after
